## Claw Command - vent crawling.

vent-crawl-verb = Crawl through vent
vent-crawl-verb-desc = Enter the vent and crawl through the pipes.
vent-crawl-cannot-now = You cannot ventcrawl in your current state!
vent-crawl-welded = The vent is welded shut.
vent-crawl-not-connected = This vent is not connected to anything.
vent-crawl-carrying = You can't carry {THE($item)} while ventcrawling!
vent-crawl-begin = You begin climbing into the ventilation system...
vent-crawl-enter = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} scrambles into the ventilation ducts!
vent-crawl-enter-self = You climb into the ventilation system.
vent-crawl-exit = You hear something squeezing through the ducts.
vent-crawl-exit-self = You climb out the ventilation system.
vent-crawl-exit-forced = You tumble out of the broken pipe.

vent-crawl-air-freezing = You feel a painful freeze coming from the vent!
vent-crawl-air-icy = You feel an icy chill coming from the vent.
vent-crawl-air-hot = You feel a hot wash coming from the vent.
vent-crawl-air-searing = You feel a searing heat coming from the vent!
vent-crawl-pressure-rushing = You feel a rushing draw pulling you into the vent!
vent-crawl-pressure-drag = You feel a strong drag pulling you into the vent.
vent-crawl-pressure-current = You feel a strong current pushing you away from the vent.
vent-crawl-pressure-roaring = You feel a roaring wind pushing you away from the vent!
